## Code
- WebGL2 and Canvas 2D in the page; the distance transform follows Felzenszwalb & Huttenlocher (2012).

## Facts
- The film states no numbers or dated facts. The one biological claim (young Atlantic salmon run down the river to the
  sea) is general knowledge; the salmon swims downstream (right) on screen. Swimming is modelled on carangiform
  locomotion (fish) and the vertical body wave of whales, simplified for the film.
